{"id":"01.06.04-S028","kind":"main","cn":"要不你先问问别人？","meaning_my":"တခြားသူကို အရင် မေးကြည့်မလား။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S028.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.06.04-S028_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"行，那我先问问别人。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ တခြားသူကို အရင် မေးကြည့်မယ်။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S028_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.06.04-S028_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"你先问问其他人吧。","meaning_my":"တခြားသူတွေကို အရင် မေးကြည့်ပါ။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S028_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.06.04-S029","kind":"main","cn":"过两天再说吧。","meaning_my":"နောက်နှစ်ရက်လောက်ကျမှ ပြန်ပြောကြမယ်နော်။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S029.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.06.04-S029_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"行，过两天再联系。","meaning_my":"ရတယ်၊ နောက်နှစ်ရက်လောက်ကျမှ ပြန်ဆက်သွယ်ကြမယ်။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S029_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.06.04-S029_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"过两天咱们再聊吧。","meaning_my":"နောက်နှစ်ရက်လောက်ကျမှ ပြန်ပြောကြမယ်နော်။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S029_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.06.04-S030","kind":"main","cn":"不如改到周末？","meaning_my":"စနေ၊ တနင်္ဂနွေကို ပြောင်းလိုက်မလား။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S030.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"01.06.04-S030_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"好，周末我有空。","meaning_my":"ကောင်းပြီ၊ စနေ၊ တနင်္ဂနွေ အားတယ်။","audio_file":"01.06.04-S030_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"}]}
